BLOCK AT LINE 2, AUTO STORAGE 4 BYTES
c 0000 N FIXED BINARY(15,0) AUTOMATIC
c 0002 M FIXED BINARY(15,0) AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

